OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely dry  
OL,6,Fwith variable cloud and clear spells   
OL,7,Fin the north, with a touch of frost in 
OL,8,Fplaces. Cloudier in the south, with    
OL,9,Fsome hill fog. Meanwhile, outbreaks of 
OL,10,Frain will reach southern areas after   
OL,11,Fmidnight. Freshening southeasterly     
OL,12,Fwinds.                                 
OL,14,CSunday:FMostly cloudy, and with        
OL,15,Fpersistent rain in the south. The best 
OL,16,Fof the sunshine will be in the north.  
OL,17,FFeeling cold, especially given the     
OL,18,Fbrisk southeasterly wind.              
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
