OL,3,GWales                                  
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FCalm  
OL,6,Fwith cloud dimming the sunshine on     
OL,7,FMonday. On Tuesday, breezy with spells 
OL,8,Fof rain. Calmer on Wednesday but with  
OL,9,Ffurther intervals of rain and cloud.   
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
